DESCRIPTION:IEEE PES Grid Edge Technologies Conference & Exposition (PES Gr
 id Edge 2027)\n\nPaper and panel proposal submission: 24 Jul 2026\, 23:59 
 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConference: April 19-22\, 2027\nLocation: Salt Lake Ci
 ty\, USA\nVenue: Calvin L. Rampton Salt Palace Convention Center\n\nAll da
 tes:\n  Paper and panel proposal submission: 24 Jul 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (a
 ssumed)\n  Notification of acceptance: 1 Oct 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)
 \n\nThe call for papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, th
 e earliest it could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the 
 real deadline rather than after it.\n\nPapers are limited to five pages\, 
 and panel proposals to a 350-word description. At least one author per acc
 epted paper must register for the paper to appear in IEEE Xplore.\n\nCall 
 for papers: https://pes-gridedge.org/\nDetails: https://langestefan.github
 .io/powersystem-deadlines/conference/pes-grid-edge27
LOCATION:Salt Lake City\, USA
URL;VALUE=URI:https://pes-gridedge.org/
